# Jungle - sunny calypso in C major over congas, bongos, woodblock and cowbell. Steel-drum lead with a
# syncopated 2-bar hook (repeated, developed), brass stabs answering, 16th marimba ostinato, pushed slap bass.
# Intro 1 bar (drums), loop 16 bars:
# A  C A7 Dm-G7 C   A' C A7 Dm-G7 C-C7   B  F Fm Em-A7 Dm-G7   A'' C A7 Dm-G7 Ab-Bb  (bVI-bVII -> C)
tempo 132
title Canopy Conga
echo 4 35 25
swing 50

# ---------------- C1: steel-drum lead ----------------
C1: @steeldrum v12 p0 q6 E1
C1: r1 |
C1: L
C1: o5 c8 e8 r8 g8 ^8 a8 g8 e8 | o5 c+8 e8 r8 a8 ^8 g8 e4 |
C1: o5 f8 a8 r8 d8 g8 b8 r8 f8 | o5 e4 r8 c4 d8 e4 |
C1: o5 c8 e8 r8 g8 ^8 a8 g8 e8 | o5 c+8 e8 r8 a8 ^8 o6 c+8 e4 |
C1: o6 d8 c8 r8 o5 a8 g8 f8 r8 d8 | o5 c4 r8 e8 g8 b-8 r4 |
C1: o5 a4 r8 f8 ^8 a8 o6 c8 r8 | o5 a-4 r8 f8 ^8 a-8 o6 c8 r8 |
C1: o5 g8 b8 r8 e8 a8 c+8 r8 e8 | o5 f4 a8 d8 g4 f8 d8 |
C1: o5 c8 e8 r8 g8 ^8 a8 g8 e8 | o5 c+8 e8 r8 a8 ^8 g8 e4 |
C1: o5 f8 a8 r8 d8 g8 b8 r8 o6 d8 | o6 c8 r8 o5 a-8 e-8 d8 r8 f8 b-8 |

